<template><div><AppPageHeader eyebrow="Contas corporativas" title="Empresas" description="Gerencie organizações contratantes, responsáveis de RH e acesso às operações B2B."><template #actions><AppButton @click="showForm=true" data-testid="new-company"><span class="text-lg">+</span>Nova empresa</AppButton></template></AppPageHeader><AppCard v-if="showForm" class="mb-7"><template #header><div><p class="premium-kicker">{{ editingId?'Edição':'Nova conta' }}</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">{{ editingId?'Editar empresa':'Cadastrar empresa' }}</h2></div></template><form @submit.prevent="saveCompany" class="space-y-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><AppInput v-model="form.legal_name" label="Razão Social *" placeholder="Empresa ABC Ltda." required/><AppInput v-model="form.trade_name" label="Nome Fantasia" placeholder="Empresa ABC"/><AppInput v-model="form.cnpj" label="CNPJ *" placeholder="00.000.000/0000-00" required/><AppInput v-model="form.rh_name" label="Contato (RH)" placeholder="Nome do responsável"/><AppInput v-model="form.rh_email" label="E-mail do RH" type="email" placeholder="rh@empresa.com"/><AppInput v-model="form.rh_phone" label="Telefone do RH" placeholder="(11) 99999-9999"/><AppInput v-model="form.city" label="Cidade" placeholder="São Paulo"/><AppInput v-model="form.state" label="Estado" placeholder="SP"/><AppInput v-model="form.zip_code" label="CEP" placeholder="00000-000"/></div><AppInput v-model="form.address" label="Endereço" placeholder="Rua, número, complemento"/><div class="flex gap-2"><AppButton type="submit" :disabled="saving" data-testid="save-company">{{ saving?'Salvando...':'Salvar empresa' }}</AppButton><AppButton type="button" variant="secondary" @click="cancelForm" data-testid="cancel-company">Cancelar</AppButton></div></form></AppCard><LoadingState v-if="loading" message="Carregando empresas..."/><AppAlert v-else-if="loadError" type="error" closable @close="loadError=''">{{ loadError }}</AppAlert><EmptyState v-else-if="companies.length===0" title="Nenhuma empresa cadastrada" description="Cadastre a primeira organização contratante para iniciar a operação B2B."/><div v-else><div class="premium-toolbar mb-5 flex items-center justify-between p-4"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">{{ companies.length }} empresas</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Visão consolidada da base corporativa</p></div><router-link to="/operations/corporate" class="hidden items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-[var(--brand-primary)] sm:inline-flex"><NavIcon name="briefcase"/>Abrir pipeline B2B →</router-link></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><article v-for="company in companies" :key="company.id" class="premium-card premium-card-hover p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--brand-primary-soft)] text-[var(--brand-primary)]"><NavIcon name="building"/></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="truncate font-bold text-slate-900">{{ company.trade_name||company.legal_name }}</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">{{ formatCnpj(company.cnpj) }}</p></div></div><details class="relative"><summary class="flex h-8 w-8 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-slate-500">•••</summary><div class="absolute right-0 z-10 mt-2 w-36 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-1.5 shadow-xl"><button @click="editCompany(company)" class="w-full rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50" data-testid="edit-company">Editar</button><button @click="deleteCompany(company)" class="w-full rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50" data-testid="delete-company">Excluir</button></div></details></div><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400">Funcionários</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-black text-slate-800">{{ employeeCounts[company.id]||0 }}</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400">Matrículas</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-black text-slate-800">{{ enrollmentCounts[company.id]||0 }}</p></div></div><div v-if="company.rh_name||company.rh_email" class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 p-3"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400">Responsável RH</p><p v-if="company.rh_name" class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">{{ company.rh_name }}</p><p v-if="company.rh_email" class="mt-0.5 truncate text-xs text-slate-400">{{ company.rh_email }}</p></div><div class="mt-5 flex gap-2"><AppButton @click="$router.push(`/companies/${company.id}`)" size="sm" variant="secondary" class="flex-1" data-testid="view-company">Ver cadastro</AppButton><AppButton @click="$router.push(`/companies/${company.id}/operations`)" size="sm" class="flex-1">Operação</AppButton></div></article></div></div><ConfirmDialog v-model="showDeleteConfirm" title="Excluir empresa" :message="deleteMessage" confirmText="Excluir" cancelText="Cancelar" :danger="true" :loading="deleting" @confirm="doDelete"/></div></template>
<script setup>import{ref,onMounted,computed}from'vue';import api from'../api/client';import AppPageHeader from'../components/AppPageHeader.vue';import AppCard from'../components/AppCard.vue';import AppButton from'../components/AppButton.vue';import AppInput from'../components/AppInput.vue';import AppAlert from'../components/AppAlert.vue';import EmptyState from'../components/EmptyState.vue';import LoadingState from'../components/LoadingState.vue';import ConfirmDialog from'../components/ConfirmDialog.vue';import NavIcon from'../components/NavIcon.vue';import{useToast}from'../composables/useToast';const{success:toastSuccess,error:toastError}=useToast();const companies=ref([]),students=ref([]),enrollments=ref([]),loading=ref(false),showForm=ref(false),editingId=ref(null),saving=ref(false),loadError=ref(''),showDeleteConfirm=ref(false),deleting=ref(false),pendingDeleteId=ref(null),pendingDeleteName=ref('');const form=ref({legal_name:'',trade_name:'',cnpj:'',rh_name:'',rh_email:'',rh_phone:'',address:'',city:'',state:'',zip_code:''});const employeeCounts=computed(()=>{const c={};for(const s of students.value)if(s.company_id)c[s.company_id]=(c[s.company_id]||0)+1;return c});const enrollmentCounts=computed(()=>{const c={},map={};for(const s of students.value)if(s.company_id)map[s.id]=s.company_id;for(const e of enrollments.value){const id=map[e.student_id];if(id)c[id]=(c[id]||0)+1}return c});const deleteMessage=computed(()=>`Excluir a empresa "${pendingDeleteName.value}"? Esta ação não pode ser desfeita.`);const formatCnpj=c=>!c||c.length!==14?c:c.replace(/(\d{2})(\d{3})(\d{3})(\d{4})(\d{2})/,'$1.$2.$3/$4-$5');const loadCompanies=async()=>{loading.value=true;loadError.value='';try{companies.value=(await api.get('/api/v1/companies/')).data}catch{loadError.value='Erro ao carregar empresas. Tente novamente.'}finally{loading.value=false}};const loadStudents=async()=>{try{students.value=(await api.get('/api/v1/students/')).data}catch{/* student list load failure — dropdown stays empty */}};const loadEnrollments=async()=>{try{enrollments.value=(await api.get('/api/v1/enrollments/')).data}catch{/* enrollment list load failure — dropdown stays empty */}};const saveCompany=async()=>{saving.value=true;try{editingId.value?await api.put(`/api/v1/companies/${editingId.value}`,form.value):await api.post('/api/v1/companies/',form.value);toastSuccess(editingId.value?'Empresa atualizada com sucesso!':'Empresa cadastrada com sucesso!');resetForm();await loadCompanies()}catch(error){toastError('Erro ao salvar empresa: '+(error.response?.data?.detail||error.message))}finally{saving.value=false}};const editCompany=c=>{editingId.value=c.id;form.value={...c};showForm.value=true};const cancelForm=()=>resetForm();const deleteCompany=c=>{pendingDeleteId.value=c.id;pendingDeleteName.value=c.trade_name||c.legal_name;showDeleteConfirm.value=true};const doDelete=async()=>{deleting.value=true;try{await api.delete(`/api/v1/companies/${pendingDeleteId.value}`);await loadCompanies();showDeleteConfirm.value=false;toastSuccess('Empresa excluída com sucesso!')}catch{toastError('Erro ao excluir empresa')}finally{deleting.value=false;pendingDeleteId.value=null;pendingDeleteName.value=''}};const resetForm=()=>{editingId.value=null;form.value={legal_name:'',trade_name:'',cnpj:'',rh_name:'',rh_email:'',rh_phone:'',address:'',city:'',state:'',zip_code:''};showForm.value=false};onMounted(async()=>{await Promise.all([loadCompanies(),loadStudents(),loadEnrollments()])})</script>
